note contract 5 fresh, line 123: a rolled loop contributes nothing (no induction), so the constant
note get after a loop that writes every element is error 27.
om2
fn f s edit uchar 8 fresh to ulong
for i ulong 8
put s i 27
end
ret ulong get s 0
end
fn main to int
a = new uchar 8 0
putd f a
ret 0
end
